// Colony definitions. HP / regen / turret weapons converted from OpenSA (mods/sa/rules/*-buildings.yaml):
//   HP 100000, ChangesHealth Step 100 per 40 ms tick -> 2500 HP/s while not producing,
//   footprint Dimensions 6,6 -> half_extent 3.0, turret ranges in cells, reloads in seconds.
// Turret offsets follow the tower positions of the rebuilt colony models (from the original sprites), NOT OpenSA.
// Turret offsets/heights are where colony_tripo.py puts the turrets on the Tripo models (it prints them).
// Units leave through the doorway in the south-east, as the original's Colony Exit Points all do
// (Game.ANI, e.g. spider +1.67,+1.67): the free corner cell of the footprint, then on to the rally point.
